WEBVTT

00:00:01.474 --> 00:00:03.810
Do you know about Season Fairies?

00:00:03.810 --> 00:00:10.739
They're tiny fairies that make
rainfall, snowfall, wind, and clouds...

00:00:11.051 --> 00:00:15.288
But she chose my room
to live in, of all places!

00:00:15.288 --> 00:00:17.424
Are you listening to me, Sugar?

00:00:17.424 --> 00:00:18.925
Sugar?

00:00:18.925 --> 00:00:20.825
Oh, yeah.

00:00:20.961 --> 00:00:23.259
She left.

00:00:24.230 --> 00:00:27.393
Sugar Baby Love

00:00:27.467 --> 00:00:30.637
On my lips

00:00:30.637 --> 00:00:35.836
The rouge of tears

00:00:55.061 --> 00:00:58.798
Sugar Baby Love

00:00:58.798 --> 00:01:05.897
I don't want to know such a thing as love

00:01:09.709 --> 00:01:13.113
Sugar Baby Love

00:01:13.113 --> 00:01:15.949
On my lips

00:01:15.949 --> 00:01:21.387
The rouge of tears

00:01:24.024 --> 00:01:27.694
On Thursdays

00:01:27.694 --> 00:01:30.663
I buy roses and...

00:01:30.663 --> 00:01:34.565
add a letter

00:01:38.505 --> 00:01:42.042
Sugar Baby Love

00:01:42.042 --> 00:01:44.978
When I see you in my dreams

00:01:44.978 --> 00:01:49.938
you're so caring

00:02:08.635 --> 00:02:13.402
I'm hungry. Saga...
Are the waffo's ready yet?

00:02:14.274 --> 00:02:15.875
Saga...

00:02:15.875 --> 00:02:17.638
Get out, now!

00:02:18.711 --> 00:02:20.947
What's wrong, Saga? Why?

00:02:20.947 --> 00:02:22.505
Shut up!

00:02:24.117 --> 00:02:26.453
-Get out.
-Saga?

00:02:26.453 --> 00:02:30.389
I don't want to see your face ever again.

00:02:36.896 --> 00:02:39.160
Stupid Saga!!

00:02:39.299 --> 00:02:41.859
Huh? What?

00:02:43.136 --> 00:02:44.337
I'm falling!

00:02:44.337 --> 00:02:46.805
What are you doing, Sugar?

00:02:48.041 --> 00:02:49.838
Oh, yeah. I can fly.

00:02:50.210 --> 00:02:52.041
Basil! Cinnamon!

00:03:03.356 --> 00:03:05.688
She never came back.

00:03:08.628 --> 00:03:11.961
I don't want to see your face ever again.

00:03:15.001 --> 00:03:16.969
Stupid Saga!!

00:03:18.204 --> 00:03:20.968
Saga... Hey, Saga.

00:03:21.374 --> 00:03:23.443
Oh, Grandma! Good morning.

00:03:23.443 --> 00:03:25.945
Don't you have to go? It's getting late.

00:03:25.945 --> 00:03:28.413
Late? Uh-oh, I have to go!

00:03:29.415 --> 00:03:30.712
I'm going now!

00:03:31.050 --> 00:03:35.077
Really? But that means
you didn't do anything wrong.

00:03:35.288 --> 00:03:37.757
Really? Do you think
so, too, Basil?

00:03:37.757 --> 00:03:39.526
Yeah. Right, Cinnamon?

00:03:39.526 --> 00:03:41.261
I'm not sure,

00:03:41.261 --> 00:03:44.797
but if that's what Sugar says,
then she didn't do anything wrong.

00:03:44.797 --> 00:03:46.799
I thought so.

00:03:46.799 --> 00:03:50.837
But then Saga goes and talks as
though everything is all my fault.

00:03:50.837 --> 00:03:55.475
Besides, she didn't pay attention
to a word I said about my mommy.

00:03:55.475 --> 00:03:58.344
She said "it has nothing to do with me!"

00:03:58.344 --> 00:04:00.813
Ooh, that makes me mad!

00:04:00.813 --> 00:04:04.284
If that's the case, you should leave
that bad house and come here.

00:04:04.284 --> 00:04:08.421
Why not? We're all apprentice Season
Fairies, so we'll have a good time!

00:04:08.421 --> 00:04:09.945
Live here?

00:04:10.657 --> 00:04:14.561
We've been here for a few days,
but we haven't ever gotten bored.

00:04:14.561 --> 00:04:16.262
We play as much as we want!

00:04:16.262 --> 00:04:17.820
Wow...

00:04:20.867 --> 00:04:22.334
Take that!

00:04:37.016 --> 00:04:38.483
Take that!

00:04:43.056 --> 00:04:44.824
Yay! Yay!

00:04:44.824 --> 00:04:47.460
Waffo! Amazing! Amazing! Amazing!

00:04:47.460 --> 00:04:51.954
That looks fun! I'll play
as much as I want, too!

00:04:53.099 --> 00:04:54.867
Okay, it's settled!

00:04:54.867 --> 00:04:56.869
Starting today, you're in our gang.

00:04:56.869 --> 00:04:59.872
Waffo! I'm in your gang!
I'm in your gang!

00:04:59.872 --> 00:05:02.742
Starting today, this is my house!

00:05:02.742 --> 00:05:04.010
-YAY!

00:05:04.010 --> 00:05:05.238
-YAY!
-YAY!

00:05:19.292 --> 00:05:22.428
Miss Saga. Miss Saga?

00:05:22.428 --> 00:05:23.396
H-Here!

00:05:23.396 --> 00:05:25.965
What's wrong, Miss Saga?
Class is in session.

00:05:25.965 --> 00:05:28.034
L-I'm sorry.

00:05:28.034 --> 00:05:33.666
Oh, my, Miss Saga. I guess there's something
more interesting in the sky than class.

00:05:34.407 --> 00:05:36.602
N-Not really.

00:05:38.878 --> 00:05:44.441
Okay, then I think we'll have Miss Greta
do the textbook question. It's on page 42.

00:05:44.617 --> 00:05:46.084
Okay.

00:05:53.159 --> 00:05:54.990
What's wrong?

00:05:56.629 --> 00:05:58.364
I think I forgot my textbook.

00:05:58.364 --> 00:06:01.856
-What?
-Saga forgot something!
-Is she sick?

00:06:05.571 --> 00:06:07.095
Stupid Sugar!

00:06:12.545 --> 00:06:17.517
She isn't here. I wonder where
Sugar could have gone...

00:06:17.517 --> 00:06:20.320
Don't tell me she found
a "Twinkle" by herself!

00:06:20.320 --> 00:06:23.312
Sugar would never do
something like that.

00:06:25.725 --> 00:06:27.860
This is really, really good!

00:06:27.860 --> 00:06:29.418
Sugar!

00:06:30.229 --> 00:06:32.390
What are you doing?

00:06:35.735 --> 00:06:38.338
Humans eat yummy stuff!

00:06:38.338 --> 00:06:40.973
They can stuff a lot into their big faces.

00:06:40.973 --> 00:06:44.844
This is pretty good, baby!
Hee, hee!

00:06:44.844 --> 00:06:46.846
Salt and Pepper! Hello!

00:06:46.846 --> 00:06:47.914
Hello...

00:06:47.914 --> 00:06:51.451
...NOT! What the heck are
you doing in a place like this?

00:06:51.451 --> 00:06:54.045
And what are you wearing?

00:06:54.387 --> 00:06:58.124
Starting today, this is
my style. Howdy-do!

00:06:58.124 --> 00:06:59.921
It doesn't suit you, does it?

00:07:00.526 --> 00:07:04.330
Hey, you guys! What do you want
with our new gang buddy?

00:07:04.330 --> 00:07:07.026
-Gang buddy?
-What's going on?

00:07:07.333 --> 00:07:11.337
Starting today, Sugar's going
to hang out and play with us.

00:07:11.337 --> 00:07:13.999
-Right, Sugar?
-Yeah! YAY!

00:07:14.807 --> 00:07:16.275
That can't be.

00:07:16.275 --> 00:07:21.372
That's how it is, so tell Saga I said, "Hi,"
and that I'm never, ever going home.

00:07:21.481 --> 00:07:24.951
All right! Next, let's race
to the end of the street!

00:07:24.951 --> 00:07:26.953
Okay, eat my dust!

00:07:26.953 --> 00:07:28.855
Let's do it! Let's do it!

00:07:28.855 --> 00:07:32.291
-Waffo!
-Hey, wait! Sugar!

00:07:35.495 --> 00:07:37.429
Waffo!

00:07:39.866 --> 00:07:40.798
YAY!

00:07:40.933 --> 00:07:42.867
Hey, you can't beat me!

00:07:43.436 --> 00:07:44.733
Yahoo!

00:07:44.871 --> 00:07:46.998
YAY! All right!

00:07:53.946 --> 00:07:55.413
Wh-What?

00:07:59.986 --> 00:08:03.256
This has taken
a strange turn, hasn't it?

00:08:03.256 --> 00:08:05.349
Yeesh. What is Saga doing?

00:08:06.626 --> 00:08:08.127
I'm sorry!

00:08:08.127 --> 00:08:12.398
But we had a plan
to go shopping today after school...

00:08:12.398 --> 00:08:15.034
I can't believe you tried to go home!

00:08:15.034 --> 00:08:17.468
I sort of forgot.

00:08:17.603 --> 00:08:21.240
But that's unusual.
You're always on schedule.

00:08:21.240 --> 00:08:24.677
Here you go. One cinnamon apple...

00:08:24.677 --> 00:08:28.848
...one cream cheese,
one orange mix, and one plain, right?

00:08:28.848 --> 00:08:31.817
-Yes, thanks!
-It looks good!

00:08:33.886 --> 00:08:35.788
Saga, are you eating both of those?

00:08:35.788 --> 00:08:37.857
Oh, I see. You're taking one home.

00:08:37.857 --> 00:08:39.484
You're wrong!

00:08:39.592 --> 00:08:41.794
You mean it isn't for
your grandmother?

00:08:41.794 --> 00:08:43.762
Huh? Uh, I mean...

00:08:43.896 --> 00:08:46.524
...I thought I should feed
the pigeons once in a while.

00:08:54.807 --> 00:08:57.071
What am I doing?

00:09:03.049 --> 00:09:05.918
Just wait, Ginger!

00:09:05.918 --> 00:09:09.355
This love letter packed
with my feelings...

00:09:09.355 --> 00:09:12.290
...will get delivered
to you this time!

00:09:32.945 --> 00:09:35.209
You're amazing, Mommy!

00:09:44.657 --> 00:09:47.353
I bet your hands are magic hands.

00:09:48.327 --> 00:09:50.522
Thank you, Saga.

00:09:54.734 --> 00:09:57.999
My mother was great, you know.

00:09:58.571 --> 00:10:00.806
Stop moping around!

00:10:00.806 --> 00:10:04.477
Aren't you worried? Sugar ran
away from home, you know!

00:10:04.477 --> 00:10:08.538
You should end this fight. It's
probably over something silly, right?

00:10:08.714 --> 00:10:11.274
She's with some bad kids.

00:10:11.417 --> 00:10:14.820
They're called Thunder
Fairy Basil and Ice Fairy Cinnamon.

00:10:14.820 --> 00:10:17.256
They are apprentice
Season Fairies like us...

00:10:17.256 --> 00:10:20.316
...only they're mischievous
and like to play pranks.

00:10:20.526 --> 00:10:23.029
At any rate, we have to
get Sugar back quick, or...

00:10:23.029 --> 00:10:24.597
Be quiet!

00:10:24.597 --> 00:10:27.800
What Sugar does has
nothing to do with me!

00:10:27.800 --> 00:10:31.065
It might seem silly
to you, but she...

00:10:31.771 --> 00:10:35.041
Look at this! It's my
mother's sheet music!

00:10:35.041 --> 00:10:39.612
Look what she did to it! I don't
know how great Sugar's mother is...

00:10:39.612 --> 00:10:41.547
...but my mother was great, too!

00:10:41.547 --> 00:10:43.845
"I'm sorry, Saga."

00:10:44.116 --> 00:10:46.584
You don't have to apologize, Pepper.

00:10:46.953 --> 00:10:48.120
It isn't that.

00:10:48.120 --> 00:10:50.289
-It's what you're holding.
-This?

00:10:50.289 --> 00:10:52.985
That's what it says in bad handwriting.

00:10:58.798 --> 00:11:04.770
"I'm sorry, Saga. Let's be friends
again soon. From Sugar"...

00:11:04.770 --> 00:11:06.328
...it says.

00:11:09.508 --> 00:11:11.772
Saga! Help us out a little!

00:11:14.213 --> 00:11:16.983
We're about to go out
looking for ghosts.

00:11:16.983 --> 00:11:18.985
They say the warehouses
in the city are haunted.

00:11:18.985 --> 00:11:20.953
You've heard the rumor
going around, right?

00:11:20.953 --> 00:11:24.156
At night, there's supposed
to be a floating will'o'wisp...

00:11:24.156 --> 00:11:27.887
...and a cold thing
that touches your cheek.

00:11:28.227 --> 00:11:30.096
Well! She's ignoring us.

00:11:30.096 --> 00:11:34.800
Too bad. She could have witnessed
the greatest discovery of the millennium.

00:11:34.800 --> 00:11:36.469
He said "ghosts".

00:11:36.469 --> 00:11:40.673
It's probably a prank. Either that,
or some Season Fairy is... Hey!

00:11:40.673 --> 00:11:41.974
Do you suppose?

00:11:41.974 --> 00:11:43.441
Sugar?

00:12:03.996 --> 00:12:06.487
Take that! And that! And that! And that!

00:12:09.068 --> 00:12:11.036
Wow! That's pretty!

00:12:14.106 --> 00:12:16.267
-Hey, Sugar!
-Huh?

00:12:16.776 --> 00:12:18.744
Let's have a magical session!

00:12:19.078 --> 00:12:20.705
Yeah!

00:12:35.928 --> 00:12:39.565
I need more training to become
a full-fledged Season Fairy.

00:12:39.565 --> 00:12:43.023
Forget training! You need
more snacks. Like this!

00:12:47.273 --> 00:12:50.910
You have to use magic
this way, or it's a waste!

00:12:50.910 --> 00:12:52.645
Let's eat it together.

00:12:52.645 --> 00:12:54.670
Yeah! Ready, set, go!

00:12:56.782 --> 00:12:59.307
Saga! Isn't this yummy?

00:13:02.922 --> 00:13:04.890
What, are you full already?

00:13:05.691 --> 00:13:07.927
Okay, we'll eat the rest.

00:13:07.927 --> 00:13:09.628
Don't do that.

00:13:09.628 --> 00:13:12.563
Sugar!

00:13:12.765 --> 00:13:17.498
Come on out! You're
in there, aren't you?

00:13:17.670 --> 00:13:19.160
Sugar!!

00:13:26.278 --> 00:13:28.681
Saga looks really mad.

00:13:28.681 --> 00:13:31.484
So that's Saga.
This has gotten interesting.

00:13:31.484 --> 00:13:33.586
We'll give her lots of scares.

00:13:33.586 --> 00:13:35.520
Huh? Hey, wait!

00:13:47.700 --> 00:13:50.669
You're in here, right?
You can't fool me...

00:14:03.048 --> 00:14:06.916
Sugar, where are you? Sugar?

00:14:11.290 --> 00:14:14.059
I'm not going home. I'm not
going home. I'm not going home.

00:14:14.059 --> 00:14:15.594
I'm never going home, so there!

00:14:15.594 --> 00:14:17.429
Hey!

00:14:17.429 --> 00:14:18.864
We finally found you!

00:14:18.864 --> 00:14:22.234
Shouldn't you be going home now?

00:14:22.234 --> 00:14:25.931
No way! If Saga apologizes,
I'll think about it, though.

00:14:26.906 --> 00:14:31.410
After all, I didn't do anything
wrong! It was her fault!

00:14:31.410 --> 00:14:33.579
You might be wrong about that.

00:14:33.579 --> 00:14:34.273
Huh?

00:14:35.948 --> 00:14:38.416
Maybe she isn't here.

00:14:41.654 --> 00:14:43.246
That's cold...

00:14:45.291 --> 00:14:49.694
What? Do you mean
the letter I wrote...

00:14:49.962 --> 00:14:52.328
...was on Saga's mother's?

00:14:52.598 --> 00:14:54.834
It was an important musical score.

00:14:54.834 --> 00:14:58.737
It was probably also very
important to Saga. That's why...

00:14:58.737 --> 00:15:01.173
Th-That can't be...

00:15:01.173 --> 00:15:03.607
I... I didn't mean to...

00:15:06.478 --> 00:15:08.105
Get out!

00:15:09.548 --> 00:15:11.015
Saga...

00:15:12.818 --> 00:15:14.945
Sugar... that isn't you?

00:15:15.821 --> 00:15:17.755
Hey, Sugar?

00:15:22.494 --> 00:15:23.961
What's that?

00:15:24.330 --> 00:15:26.465
Saga!

00:15:26.465 --> 00:15:27.932
Let's go!

00:15:32.504 --> 00:15:34.597
-We're going in!
-Y-Yeah!

00:15:37.877 --> 00:15:39.344
Take that! And that!

00:15:40.813 --> 00:15:42.280
What is this?

00:15:44.917 --> 00:15:46.885
Ow!

00:15:48.888 --> 00:15:50.515
I hate this...

00:15:58.898 --> 00:16:02.265
Stop fooling around.
You give me nothing but trouble...

00:16:02.768 --> 00:16:05.070
Come home, now!

00:16:05.070 --> 00:16:06.238
Saga!!

00:16:06.238 --> 00:16:07.172
Sugar?

00:16:07.172 --> 00:16:08.730
Hee-yah!

00:16:10.976 --> 00:16:12.378
H-Hey, Sugar...

00:16:12.378 --> 00:16:14.278
W... Waffo...

00:16:14.680 --> 00:16:16.548
What're you doing, Sugar?

00:16:16.548 --> 00:16:19.285
Isn't this the human
that picked on you?

00:16:19.285 --> 00:16:20.953
That's why we're teaching her a lesson!

00:16:20.953 --> 00:16:22.855
Don't get in our way! You're
supposed to be in our gang!

00:16:22.855 --> 00:16:26.586
You're wrong! If you're going to pick
on Saga, you're no friend of mine!

00:16:27.459 --> 00:16:29.359
-Fine!
-Wanna fight?

00:16:43.909 --> 00:16:45.477
Um, Saga...

00:16:45.477 --> 00:16:46.944
Stupid!

00:16:48.047 --> 00:16:50.345
What are you doing in this place?

00:16:51.450 --> 00:16:55.154
But... But you're the one
who told me to get out!

00:16:55.154 --> 00:16:57.384
I can go wherever I want to...

00:16:58.190 --> 00:17:02.149
Weren't you going to become
a Snow Fairy like your mother?

00:17:02.461 --> 00:17:05.021
Don't make me worry about you.

00:17:09.435 --> 00:17:12.529
Hey! Basil! Cinnamon!

00:17:14.907 --> 00:17:16.475
E-Elder!

00:17:16.475 --> 00:17:20.846
You used your magic for mischief!
What do you think Season Fairies are?

00:17:20.846 --> 00:17:23.838
I'm going to punish you plenty
for this, so get ready!

00:17:24.550 --> 00:17:26.609
-L-I'm sorry...
-l-I'm sorry...

00:17:27.019 --> 00:17:30.011
Huh? When did you get here, Elder?

00:17:30.356 --> 00:17:34.059
Oh, my. You knew this
would happen, didn't you?

00:17:34.059 --> 00:17:36.328
You're incredible, Elder.

00:17:36.328 --> 00:17:38.296
Hmm, I wonder.

00:17:38.530 --> 00:17:41.333
That's right. I'm incredible. YAY!

00:17:41.333 --> 00:17:43.235
Oh. Elder, what is that?

00:17:43.235 --> 00:17:47.840
Ouch! I totally forgot. I have to
tell her how I feel immediately!

00:17:47.840 --> 00:17:51.640
Wait for me, Ginger!

00:17:52.144 --> 00:17:53.611
Saga!

00:17:54.680 --> 00:17:56.382
Huh? Where are the ghosts?

00:17:56.382 --> 00:17:57.483
Phil?

00:17:57.483 --> 00:17:59.318
You saw them, right? C'mon, Saga.

00:17:59.318 --> 00:18:00.719
Well, uh... Actually...

00:18:00.719 --> 00:18:03.381
-Hey, Phil.
-Where are you?

00:18:12.431 --> 00:18:16.231
Oh, is that all the ghosts were?

00:18:21.740 --> 00:18:24.607
That's right. There are
no ghosts in here.

00:18:26.812 --> 00:18:29.212
-I'm home!
-Hi, Saga.

00:18:35.154 --> 00:18:37.520
Hey, Saga... I...

00:18:39.525 --> 00:18:42.858
L-Listen, uh... I'm sorry!

00:18:43.262 --> 00:18:45.497
That's what you wrote, right?

00:18:45.497 --> 00:18:46.964
Huh?

00:18:53.605 --> 00:18:55.470
Me, too.

00:19:20.499 --> 00:19:25.838
Pepper told me. She said that paper
was something important to your mother.

00:19:25.838 --> 00:19:27.806
I can't believe I did that.

00:19:27.806 --> 00:19:29.208
It's okay.

00:19:29.208 --> 00:19:35.408
I've taken a liking to your mother.
She makes such wonderful music.

00:19:35.881 --> 00:19:37.349
Thanks.

00:19:37.349 --> 00:19:41.877
I'd love to meet her.
Say, when will she come home?

00:19:42.020 --> 00:19:46.425
You said it was okay, but
I should apologize to her.

00:19:46.425 --> 00:19:50.229
Oh, yeah. I guess your
mother can't see me.

00:19:50.229 --> 00:19:53.899
I'm sorry. My mother died.

00:19:53.899 --> 00:19:55.491
Huh?

00:20:01.273 --> 00:20:04.970
It was in an accident,
about 3 years ago.

00:20:06.512 --> 00:20:07.945
So...

00:20:08.881 --> 00:20:09.711
Huh?

00:20:10.883 --> 00:20:14.683
I'm sorry, Saga!
I didn't know that!

00:20:15.154 --> 00:20:17.789
H-Hey. Why do you have to cry?

00:20:17.789 --> 00:20:19.848
Because... Because...

00:20:20.893 --> 00:20:23.691
Come on. Be a good girl. Come on...

00:20:29.067 --> 00:20:32.195
Come on, stop crying. Now blow.

00:20:35.707 --> 00:20:39.478
She was a pianist. It was her job...

00:20:39.478 --> 00:20:43.209
...to make everyone feel wonderful,
just like your mother.

00:20:44.016 --> 00:20:47.383
Say, Saga? I have a favor to ask.

00:20:48.353 --> 00:20:51.290
Would you play it just one more time?

00:20:51.290 --> 00:20:53.692
I won't cry anymore. Please?

00:20:53.692 --> 00:20:55.260
Okay then, Sugar.

00:20:55.260 --> 00:20:56.727
Yeah!

00:21:30.896 --> 00:21:32.363
Saga...

00:21:41.273 --> 00:21:42.900
Be quiet!!

00:21:44.476 --> 00:21:48.113
Knock it off! You're bothering my studies!

00:21:48.113 --> 00:21:51.173
YOU knock it off! You're bothering my music!

00:21:51.383 --> 00:21:52.818
What did you say?

00:21:52.818 --> 00:21:53.919
What's it to you?

00:21:53.919 --> 00:21:56.121
In the first place, why do you
have to do that in my room?

00:21:56.121 --> 00:21:58.523
Not again. They never learn.

00:21:58.523 --> 00:22:02.755
Why not? It's entertaining to watch.

00:22:20.712 --> 00:22:25.183
Wishes upon the Moon

00:22:25.183 --> 00:22:28.887
Melting in the water

00:22:28.887 --> 00:22:34.059
I found a street lined with trees

00:22:34.059 --> 00:22:38.621
Songs of stardust

00:22:38.897 --> 00:22:47.439
The breeze crossing over
the Bridge of Rainbows

00:22:47.439 --> 00:22:52.811
You already knew...

00:22:52.811 --> 00:22:57.582
the happiness of connecting our hearts

00:22:57.582 --> 00:22:59.618
Sugar Snow

00:22:59.618 --> 00:23:07.826
When powdery snow whirls in town

00:23:07.826 --> 00:23:12.898
the season of flower blossoms is near...

00:23:12.898 --> 00:23:17.803
and, I think of you.

00:23:17.803 --> 00:23:26.244
The love that melts our hearts and...

00:23:26.244 --> 00:23:35.209
the dreams are in your heart

00:23:40.892 --> 00:23:44.629
Preview of the Next Episode
Ah... A soft, fluffy bed
is the comfiest!

00:23:44.629 --> 00:23:47.532
Yesterday, I slept with a bird.

00:23:47.532 --> 00:23:49.301
Oh, is that what happened?

00:23:49.301 --> 00:23:53.405
Actually, come to think of it, you
haven't had a bath since yesterday!

00:23:53.405 --> 00:23:55.841
Huh? Uh, that's because, uh...

00:23:55.841 --> 00:23:58.343
Okay! You're having another
shampoo before bed!

00:23:58.343 --> 00:24:00.278
No-o-o!

00:24:00.278 --> 00:24:03.815
"A Little Snow Fairy Sugar"
The next episode is
"The Shape of Dreams"

00:24:03.815 --> 00:24:07.581
I'm going to become
a scientist. You'll see!
